   "description": "<p>Your [Ranged, Weapon] Actions can bounce off one surface on the way. The projectile goes from the surface to the creature, and you calculate Line of Effect, Cover and Sight from the center of the surface. The distance is the total the projectile travels: if you shoot at a surface 5 squares from you and the target is within 6 squares of the surface, that is an 11-square shot. You must still perceive the creature to target them. A bounced shot takes 1 Bane.</p>",
   "flavor": "Walls, shields and stones are just more angles.",
